                        "entry_id": "de8c695e-5d0f-3b45-a6fd-073713af5ee1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In an indescribable manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9617ed2c-b3d9-449b-8dc5-4f80ba9eef91",
                                "sense_id": "20d9ac71-e8c6-3490-84ea-126feeebe488",
                                "text": "The appearance of the dead was indescribably ghastly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "204708f8-0218-48fc-94d9-ac1cd99e848f",
                                "sense_id": "20d9ac71-e8c6-3490-84ea-126feeebe488",
                                "text": "There was something indescribably nerve-shaking and menacing in that constant mutter, which seemed to shape itself into the very syllables of the half-breed, endlessly repeated, \"We will kill you if we can.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7ec8fcd1-87de-4735-be37-5df55808c177",
                                "sense_id": "20d9ac71-e8c6-3490-84ea-126feeebe488",
                                "text": "“I felt this sense of relief that I didn’t have to lie anymore, and that I could start taking responsibility even though I felt indescribably bad.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
